cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "AP-WGAN: Admissibility-Preserving Pseudo-Absence Generation"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of AP-WGAN, an admissibility-preserving Wasserstein
  GAN whose ordinal output heads emit only covariate values permitted by a
  reclassification scheme, together with the admissibility diagnostic and the
  evaluation gate described in the accompanying paper.
type: software
license: MIT
